{
    "title": "Solitaire Butterfly",
    "description": "Solitaire Butterfly is a creative classic card game (also known as Patience) with a breathtaking butterfly theme, allowing you to play offline without the need for an internet connection. Enjoy not only classic card games but also the opportunity to travel the world and admire butterflies dancing in beautiful landscapes like forests, grasslands, rainforests, and countryside. Relax and immerse yourself in this exquisite butterfly-themed Solitaire game!\r\n\r\n<b>Classic Solitaire Game with Charming Butterflies:</b>\r\nUpon the foundation of classic solitaire game (also known as Patience), we have designed 12 stunning scenes and over 200 beautiful butterflies that soar through fields and forest streams!\r\n\r\n<b>Discover and Collect Butterflies in this Solitaire Game:</b>\r\nExplore all five continents worldwide, each with its unique terrain and ecosystems. Collect different butterfly chrysalises from around the globe, hatch them, and watch them dance across various scenic backdrops!\r\n\r\n<b>Unique Cards and Victory Animations:</b>\r\nFeaturing a plethora of distinct card faces and backs, both classic and creative. Additionally, every time you complete card games, you'll enjoy cheerful victory animations. Each card and animation is meticulously crafted, attainable through completing card games or activities - don't miss out on any!\r\n\r\n<b>Extra Rewards Hidden in Exciting Events:</b>\r\nWe regularly host fun events to enhance your gaming experience. If you enjoy discovering new things, don't miss our game events where you can uncover incredible and exquisite butterflies alongside special rewards. Surprise events like beautiful puzzles, special rainbow butterflies, star-themed events, and more are waiting for you!\r\n\r\n<b>Conquer Crown Challenges:</b>\r\nApart from the classic Patience games, there are numerous challenging card games available to train your brain by completing daily challenges. Earn splendid butterfly trophies by completing these daily challenges - the more you accomplish, the greater the crowns and rewards you receive!\r\n\r\n<b>Left-Handed Mode Available:</b>\r\nTo provide the best gaming experience for millions of players worldwide, we offer multiple language options and support switching between left-handed and right-handed modes. You can easily switch between languages and left-handed mode at any time! Special props are also available to help you play Solitaire.\r\n\r\nIf you love classic Solitaire card games, you'll surely enjoy this classic Patience card game with a butterfly theme. Don't hesitate - download now and explore the myriad creative features of this amazing card game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire Butterfly is a creative classic card game (also known as Patience) with a breathtaking butterfly theme, allowing you to play offline without the need for an internet connection. Enjoy not only classic card games but also the opportunity to travel the world and admire butterflies dancing in beautiful landscapes like forests, grasslands, rainforests, and countryside. Relax and immerse yourself in this exquisite butterfly-themed Solitaire game!<br><br><b>Classic Solitaire Game with Charming Butterflies:</b><br>Upon the foundation of classic solitaire game (also known as Patience), we have designed 12 stunning scenes and over 200 beautiful butterflies that soar through fields and forest streams!<br><br><b>Discover and Collect Butterflies in this Solitaire Game:</b><br>Explore all five continents worldwide, each with its unique terrain and ecosystems. Collect different butterfly chrysalises from around the globe, hatch them, and watch them dance across various scenic backdrops!<br><br><b>Unique Cards and Victory Animations:</b><br>Featuring a plethora of distinct card faces and backs, both classic and creative. Additionally, every time you complete card games, you&#39;ll enjoy cheerful victory animations. Each card and animation is meticulously crafted, attainable through completing card games or activities - don&#39;t miss out on any!<br><br><b>Extra Rewards Hidden in Exciting Events:</b><br>We regularly host fun events to enhance your gaming experience. If you enjoy discovering new things, don&#39;t miss our game events where you can uncover incredible and exquisite butterflies alongside special rewards. Surprise events like beautiful puzzles, special rainbow butterflies, star-themed events, and more are waiting for you!<br><br><b>Conquer Crown Challenges:</b><br>Apart from the classic Patience games, there are numerous challenging card games available to train your brain by completing daily challenges. Earn splendid butterfly trophies by completing these daily challenges - the more you accomplish, the greater the crowns and rewards you receive!<br><br><b>Left-Handed Mode Available:</b><br>To provide the best gaming experience for millions of players worldwide, we offer multiple language options and support switching between left-handed and right-handed modes. You can easily switch between languages and left-handed mode at any time! Special props are also available to help you play Solitaire.<br><br>If you love classic Solitaire card games, you&#39;ll surely enjoy this classic Patience card game with a butterfly theme. Don&#39;t hesitate - download now and explore the myriad creative features of this amazing card game!",
